[[File:Dryrock Mine.png|thumb|300px]]
'''The Dryrock Mine''' is a mithril mine that runs in the mountain beneath [[Gilneas City]]. It is responsible with supplying the Gilnean Royal Army with ore for its equipment.<ref>{{questlong|Horde|45|Heist in Dryrock Mine}}</ref> Crown Prince [[Liam Greymane]] and Princess [[Tess Greymane]] were held captive here by forces loyal to the Regent-Lords Harlow without the knowledge of [[Genn Greymane|their father]], who had been informed by the Regent-Lords that they had tragically perished at sea along with [[Isiden Perenolde]].<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|42|Wolf Amongst Sheep}}</ref><ref>[[Celia's Journal]]</ref>

