'''Dun Kithas''' is an [[Alliance]] town located in the south of the [[Grim Reaches]].

Following the disastrous [[War of the Three Hammers]], many of the dwarven clans sworn to the Wildhammer deserted their old homes of [[Grim Batol]], [[Kalvanost]] and Dun Kithas, and wandered the northern realms in search of new lands to call their own. The fair Sky King of Dun Kithas, [[Redoran]], flew far into the west with many of his brethren until he came to the [[Gilneas (kingdom)|Gilnean]] city of [[Gelnor]]. There, he and his people settled after being gifted a place in Gelnor and to Redoran a seat at the court of Queen [[Elaena Greymane]].<ref>[[The Dwarves of Gelnor]]</ref>

