'''Dun Garok''' is a [[dwarf|dwarven]] keep nestled into the southeastern hills of the [[Hillsbrad Foothills]]. Led by [[Captain Ironhill]], the dwarves help protect the humans of [[Hillsbrad]] as well as the [[Azurelode Mine]]. The [[Forsaken]] of [[Tarren Mill]] loathe the presence of these dwarves and offer several quests for [[Horde]] adventurers to infiltrate Dun Garok and kill the dwarves within.

