The '''Dun Kithas Magistrate''', also known as the '''Magistrate's Hall''',<ref name="Preparations">{{questlong|Alliance|32|Preparations for War}}</ref> is the seat of rule for the [[Council of Dun Kithas]]. Additionally, it appears to house all of [[Dun Kithas]]' census records and historical archives. The top floor is the library<ref>[https://x.com/turtlecraft/status/1940667630672548216 Turtle WoW Team on Twitter] (2025-07-03) (dead link)</ref> and the bottom floor is the Council Hall.<ref name="Preparations" />

